Now P2: Fix double menu rendering. Currently renderHUD always runs, and during menu phase it calls _renderMenuPrompt which overlaps with renderMenu.

The simplest fix: don't call renderMenu separately, and let renderHUD/renderOverlay handle it. Or: only call renderHUD during non-menu phases.

Actually, looking at the code flow:
```javascript
// Full menu screen during menu phase
if (R.state && R.state.phase === 'menu' && typeof R.renderMenu === 'function') {
    R.renderMenu(ctx);
}
if (typeof R.renderHUD === 'function') { R.renderHUD(ctx); }
if (typeof R.renderOverlay === 'function') { R.renderOverlay(ctx); }
```

renderHUD calls renderOverlay which calls _renderMenuPrompt during menu phase. So the menu renders twice (renderMenu + _renderMenuPrompt).

Fix: Remove the R.renderMenu call, or guard R.renderHUD to skip menu phase. The simplest is to remove the standalone renderMenu call and let the HUD/overlay system handle it:

